WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.520
What nonsense

00:01.600 --> 00:02.640
The imperial seal

00:02.720 --> 00:04.960
Has always been in the Sikong family's hands

00:05.040 --> 00:06.360
Go back and tell Shilang

00:06.440 --> 00:08.240
If he's willing to bare his back and carry thorns

00:08.320 --> 00:09.987
And surrender to Great Xuan

00:10.840 --> 00:11.880
I might

00:11.960 --> 00:13.360
Bring out the seal

00:13.520 --> 00:14.840
To show him

00:14.920 --> 00:15.600
Your Highness

00:15.680 --> 00:17.120
Why go this far?

00:17.280 --> 00:18.680
Throw them out

00:18.960 --> 00:20.040
Your Highness

00:20.120 --> 00:22.040
General Shilang really has the seal

00:22.120 --> 00:23.520
Your Highness

00:24.320 --> 00:26.320
Shilang's words that disrupt our morale

00:26.440 --> 00:27.840
Whoever spreads them

00:27.960 --> 00:28.920
Will face military law

00:29.000 --> 00:30.400
Yes

00:59.480 --> 01:00.880
General

01:01.920 --> 01:02.680
General

01:02.760 --> 01:03.480
General

01:03.560 --> 01:05.440
What exactly did Prince of Jin say?

01:05.520 --> 01:06.840
Just tell the truth

01:06.920 --> 01:08.280
Don't underestimate my magnanimity

01:12.520 --> 01:13.720
General

01:13.800 --> 01:15.200
He

01:15.760 --> 01:16.920
Said

01:17.000 --> 01:18.667
If the general is willing

01:19.200 --> 01:21.440
To bare his back and carry thorns

01:21.520 --> 01:23.187
And surrender to Great Xuan

01:23.600 --> 01:25.000
He's willing to bring

01:25.120 --> 01:26.520
The real thing

01:26.760 --> 01:28.160
To show you

01:32.040 --> 01:34.200
I'm always fair in rewards and punishments

01:34.280 --> 01:35.947
Since the job was botched

01:36.600 --> 01:37.960
Drag him behind a horse

01:38.040 --> 01:39.640
Three times around the city

01:39.720 --> 01:40.240
Yes

01:40.320 --> 01:40.680
No!

01:40.760 --> 01:41.400
General

01:41.480 --> 01:42.840
Spare me, General

01:42.920 --> 01:43.400
Spare my life

01:43.480 --> 01:44.680
General

01:44.760 --> 01:46.160
General, spare my life

01:58.920 --> 02:00.160
You Xuan people

02:00.240 --> 02:01.640
Are just useless

02:02.240 --> 02:03.040
General

02:03.120 --> 02:03.680
General

02:03.760 --> 02:05.000
There's another plan

02:05.080 --> 02:06.240
As I know

02:06.320 --> 02:07.600
The Wuyang commander Chen Ying

02:07.680 --> 02:08.600
Is backed by

02:08.680 --> 02:09.480
Xuan Kingdom's Prince of Ning

02:09.560 --> 02:11.040
Who doesn't get along with Prince of Jin

02:11.120 --> 02:13.280
We can spread the false news that Prince of Jin got the seal

02:13.360 --> 02:14.440
To

02:14.520 --> 02:15.920
Wuyang

02:17.440 --> 02:18.360
Good dog

02:18.440 --> 02:19.720
Good dog

02:19.800 --> 02:21.160
You'll be rewarded

02:21.240 --> 02:21.960
Thank you, General

02:22.040 --> 02:22.600
Thank you, General

02:22.680 --> 02:23.960
Do as he says

02:24.040 --> 02:26.040
Also have those who came line up

02:26.120 --> 02:27.080
Yes
